# i18n (i18next)

## Non-negotiable: `defaultValue` on every translation call

Every `t()`, `i18next.t()`, and provider `translate()` **must** pass English fallback:

```tsx
// BAD — fails yarn i18n:check
t("settings.storage.summary.copy")
t("settings.foo", { count: n })

// GOOD
t("settings.storage.summary.copy", { defaultValue: "Copy" })
t("settings.foo", { count: n, defaultValue: "{{count}} items" })
```

Non-React contexts: `i18next.t("key", { defaultValue: "..." })`.

## Namespaces

| Code location | Hook / API | Key example |
|---------------|------------|-------------|
| Pages (`pages/**`) | `useTranslation("labelstudio")` | `pages.Home.HomePage.welcome` |
| Shell (`components/**`) | `useTranslation("components")` | `components.Menubar.Menubar.home` |
| Shared lib (`libs/app-common/**`) | `useTranslation("app-common")` | `appCommon.pages.AccountSettings.sections.Hotkeys.Help.keyboardShortcuts` |
| Data Manager (`libs/datamanager/**`) | `useTranslation("datamanager")` | `datamanager.components.MainView.DataView.empty-state.EmptyState.importDataTitle` |

Flat keys only (`keySeparator: false`). Full key in `t()` — no `keyPrefix`.

## Do not translate

- Keyboard codes, URL paths, internal constants
- `CreateProject/Config/tags.js`, `recipes.js` (labeling XML)
- `data-testid`, class names

## Yarn commands (do not run all five in sequence)

| Command | Use when |
|---------|----------|
| `yarn i18n:instrument` | New page pilot: instrument → **forced** Agent review → check → extract |
| `yarn i18n:agent-review` | Re-review only (instrument already done) |
| `yarn i18n:extract` | Daily string changes; includes migrate + backfill |
| `yarn i18n:backfill` | Standalone MT; `--force` / `--stale` |
| `yarn i18n:check` | Pre-commit; source + en only (not zh quality) |

```bash
cd web
# Pilot（可省略 --scope，从 git 变更 auto-detect）
yarn i18n:instrument -- --scope=pages/Home
yarn i18n:agent-review
# Daily
I18N_EXTRACT_SCOPE=pages/Home yarn i18n:extract
yarn i18n:check
```

HeidiTips：`HeidiTip.tsx` 用 `useTranslation("heidi-tips")` + `heidiTips.{collection}.{treatment}.{title|content|link}` + `defaultValue`（英文来自 `/heidi-tips` 或 content.ts）；文案在 `locales/*/heidi-tips.json`（`ignoreNamespaces`，extract 不碰）；`yarn i18n:instrument -- --scope=components/HeidiTips` 后 `yarn i18n:extract`（自动 seed-heidi-keys）+ backfill。

Extend `i18n/config.json` modules / `I18N_EXTRACT_SCOPE` **before** scanning new dirs (`removeUnusedKeys: true`).

